起来。现在再回头看那个坐在聚会里害怕的自己，你心里会冒出什么感觉？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2284,"promptTokens":3169,"completionTokens":169,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:29:47"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":25,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0109837204674936,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af6761bf4429d1fd72f77ba","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536987328,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:29:47","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6761bf4429d1fd72f77ba","chatId":"c3b7b4d0474f402d94cbcb209749ce85","sessionId":null,"userId":99848,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"（怔了一下）最早……可能是我爸生病那阵吧。家里气氛很紧，我妈总说别添乱。我好像就是从那时候起，觉得自己的害怕是不该有的。<第12轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0109837204674936,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":6,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":6,"sort":9},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":5,"sort":6},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":3,"sort":5},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":2,"sort":4},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":1,"sort":3},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":1,"sort":7},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2}],"relationId":"6af6761bf4429d1fd72f77bb","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536987326,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:29:47","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":{"emotion":{"type":"悲观","keywords":["担忧","犹豫","害怕","心疼","自我怀疑"],"originalText":["可要说具体是